# =====================================================
# Third-party content quarantine
# Excluded from git until per-asset provenance audit
# completes. See ADR-0003 follow-ups.
# =====================================================

# Default: ignore everything under project Content/
# Then explicitly un-ignore the known-safe folders below.
# Plugins/Myika/Content/ is the actual deliverable surface and
# is NOT affected by these rules (only project Content/ is).
Content/*
!Content/ThirdPerson/
!Content/Input/
!Content/LevelPrototyping/
!Content/Variant_Combat/
!Content/Variant_Platforming/
!Content/Variant_SideScrolling/
!Content/Collections/
!Content/Developers/

# Fab marketplace plugin (third-party redistribution unverified)
Plugins/GaeaUnrealTools/

# Notes:
# - Content/Materials/ — Megascans/Quixel/scan library; redistribution restricted
# - Content/Characters/ — character pack; verify provenance
# - Content/Landscape/ — likely contains imported landscape MF library (CellBomb etc.)
# - Content/Water/ — verify per-folder origin
# - Content/Terrain/ — Haven.umap is OK in principle but contains references to quarantined assets
# - Content/Effects/ — verify per-folder origin
# - Content/__ExternalActors__/ + __ExternalObjects__/ — World Partition references; pull in once their parent maps are un-ignored
